\p{In early June we had a lovely week in Sweden at the
[institut Mittag-Leffer](mittag-leffler) for a [workshop on formalising higher
category theory](hcatml). It was interesting to hear about other approaches people
were taking and it was great to be invited, alongside [[fredrikbakke]],
[[ulrikbuchholtz]] and [[jonathanweinberger]] to run the '\em{simplicial HoTT}'
working group. We had a lot of interest over the week and managed to get quite a few
pull requests merged from a variety of people.}


